######################
# RockCore .gitignore
# 排除构建产物、IDE 缓存、发布输出与本地数据
######################

##### .NET / MSBuild 构建产物 #####
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vshost.exe
*.vshost.*

##### NuGet #####
[Nn]uGet/
packages/
!**/packages/repositories.config
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json

##### Visual Studio 2015+ #####
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.sdf
*.vsp
*.aps
*.apsui
*.cachefile
*.psess
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.tlog
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

##### Rider / 其他 IDE #####
.idea/
*.iml

##### 发布输出（自包含便携版，走 GitHub Releases 分发，不入代码库）#####
[pP]ublish/
dist/
release/
build/
out/

##### 本地数据 / 配置 / 密钥 #####
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
logs/
*.local
appsettings.Local.*
.env
.env.*
secrets/
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key

##### Windows 系统文件 #####
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

##### 日志 #####
*.log

##### 设计/临时资源（保留，按需用 .gitattributes 标注 binary）#####
!docs/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.jpg
!src/RockCore.Wpf/Resources/*.ico
